{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8a0eafae-6701-5a61-85e7-ad80625ccd26", "source_ordinal": 1884, "reading_ordinal": 2172, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "向钱看", "published_at": "2023-12-16T10:41:26+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/460116131/answer/3327552759"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "必须要有一代人甚至几代人用自己的人生从正反两方面证实“把钱放在第一位的方法论并不好”，然后把经验 / 教训传给自己的子侄、近亲。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 64}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "所谓正反两方面，一个是“没把钱放在第一位，结果赚大钱了”，一个是“把钱放在第一位，结果眼睁睁看着认识的人做了相反选择赚了大钱而自己却最后走投无路”。", "char_start": 65, "char_end": 139}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "于是刻骨铭心，于是不厌其烦、絮絮叨叨的在家念叨了半辈子，所有的晚辈都耳熟能详、感同身受了。", "char_start": 140, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "除了这个途径之外，别的做法都是没有太大用处的。没用处的原因主要是社会规律本身就不支持“所有人都不把钱放在第一位”的安排。", "char_start": 186, "char_end": 246}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "“把钱放在第一位”的人，换一个视角来看，就是“无条件响应社会最显著的需求”的人。如果一个社会里居然没有一个相当比例的人口在满足这个缺口，这个社会可想而知是不够稳定的。", "char_start": 247, "char_end": 330}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "社会当然需要足够的，甚至是过剩的人口来满足自己最热切的需求，这对社会本身而言是不言而喻的更有利的安排。", "char_start": 331, "char_end": 382}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "问题是，这对响应者们——尤其是那些过剩部分的响应者们，是一个残酷的机制。社会并不考虑“这些过剩的响应者们要如何安置”这个问题。天道无亲，maybe next life。", "char_start": 383, "char_end": 467}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "只有少部分人可以出于机缘巧合领受那些“不以钱为第一位可以得到更大回报”的确切的见证，而被引导到这条路上来。也只有这样的亲身见证可以基本保证压倒那些人声鼎沸的“你不爱钱、钱不爱你”论。", "char_start": 468, "char_end": 559}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "对没有得到过这种见证烙印的家族而言，仅仅靠某个大人物的呼吁或者重申所谓的传统智慧是没有用的，因为社会规律就像一个无限富有的对手，总是可以用真金白银诱惑出足够多的人来走“把钱放在第一位”的道路。", "char_start": 560, "char_end": 656}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "某种意义上讲，从宏观角度，这种分化是注定的，是不可改变的，甚至连走这两条路的人口比例都是由时代背景提前决定的，几乎不会受到宣传、呼吁的任何显著影响。", "char_start": 657, "char_end": 731}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "在一个追赶先进水平、补历史缺课阶段的社会里，存在大量急切而明确的社会需求，社会就会把“向钱看”的人口比例调高一点，把“不止看钱”的人口比例调低一点。这时候看钱派的声势就大，影响力自然更强。", "char_start": 732, "char_end": 826}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "过了这个阶段，所有竞争都饱和了，也失去明确的追赶对象了，这个比例就会被调低点，看钱派挨的教训就更多，说话也就没那么有说服力。换言之，的确是会有人被历史选中能从“一切看钱”策略中获益的，没有必要一定要否定这个策略，只是也不要认为这个策略“才是真相”——因为你也可能是过剩的那一批。", "char_start": 827, "char_end": 966}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "同时你要注意一个宏观规律——追赶领域看钱，饱和领域看积累和定力。至于你是哪个领域，就要看自己的判断了。", "char_start": 967, "char_end": 1018}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "真正为难的是——很多人，尤其是年轻人，往往没有“我是哪个领域”的明确概念，所以往往会跟着最简单显性的信号跑。", "char_start": 1019, "char_end": 1073}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这才是年轻人常常“只看钱”的原因。", "char_start": 1074, "char_end": 1091}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "甚至说得不好听一点，除了那些明确的追随性的（因此也是更“看钱”的）行业之外，年轻人们甚至都不知道还有啥其他的选择存在，只知道自己已经毕业了，必须要赶紧找个工作。", "char_start": 1092, "char_end": 1172}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这问题其实不完全出在年轻人身上，而是出在中国的历史阶段上——中国还需要一两代人在饱和经济条件下积累“不能唯利是图”的成功经验。", "char_start": 1173, "char_end": 1236}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "在这之前，只能看着部分人成为过剩的人力资源。", "char_start": 1237, "char_end": 1259}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0323"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：董明珠称「年轻人找工作把钱放第一位，对未来没有很好定位」，如何看待这一说法？怎样找到自己的定位？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“向钱看”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“必须要有一代人甚至几代人用自己的人生从正反两方面证实“把钱放在第一位的方法论并不好”，然后把经验 / 教训传给自己的子侄、近亲。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "必须要有一代人甚至几代人用自己的人生从正反两方面证实“把钱放在第一位的方法论并不好”，然后把经验 / 教训传给自己的子侄、近亲。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 64, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0b17f32e-e171-5888-9b3d-d5b1c7d3dca9", "source_ordinal": 1883, "reading_ordinal": 2173, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "德雷克医生", "published_at": "2023-12-17T13:45:47+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/635225975/answer/3328725783"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "其实网友们拼命的站队董宇辉和站队站队董宇辉的大V们，在内心深处都是在希望促成一个“平民明星战胜资本”的梦。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 53}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "所以几乎没有人在深究“这位主播的台词到底是他自己写的还是来自文案团队”这个问题。", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 94}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果这文案真不是他自己写的，他只是扮演一个播音员角色，那么如果董自己出走而文案团队没跟自己一起走，在下一家能不能播出同一个效果？", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 159}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "如果效果大变，舆论那时会怎么看待这个问题？", "char_start": 160, "char_end": 181}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "还捧吗？", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 186}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "还是突然潮头逆转？骂他欺骗了大家的感情，是个卑鄙的、贪婪的骗子？", "char_start": 187, "char_end": 219}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "说实在的，真正的要害是这些文案到底是不是董自己写的？既然已经矛盾激烈到这一步，这一点董能不能给个明确的结论？", "char_start": 220, "char_end": 274}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "他能不能给这结论？", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 284}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "其实他又不敢给——因为他如果点头承认“大部分文案不是我写的”，结果就跟韩寒承认文章都是代笔一样严重。", "char_start": 285, "char_end": 335}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "他的真正保护者、依仗，反而是还指着他的偶像形象来赚钱的母公司不愿意失去这份无形资产，所以自己故意模糊掉了这个关键问题的答案，打了马虎眼。", "char_start": 336, "char_end": 404}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "如果这文案真是他自己写的，那么的确可以讲公司的业绩是他个人赏赐的。", "char_start": 405, "char_end": 438}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "如果不是，他的所得就早已超过了一个播音员应得的水平，他再尝试讲“稿子都是我写的，文案团队不过敲敲边鼓”，这就属于绝对的贪得无厌。网上多少人力挺，都是一样。", "char_start": 439, "char_end": 516}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "所以说，可惜没分开，其实真分开了，试一试就知道谁才是过线的一方。", "char_start": 517, "char_end": 549}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "编剧、导演、美术和武指才是创作团队的核心，演员虽在台前享受一切的大众目光，但是最好搞清楚这份职业的道德底线。", "char_start": 550, "char_end": 604}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "哪怕是周星驰，也不会随便说“这片子其实是我导的”。因为这话哪怕是事实，也只有别人可以说，你自己说，说完你就死。", "char_start": 605, "char_end": 660}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "君不见，德雷克医生说了句剧情都是我想的，转眼就掉进电梯井摔死了？", "char_start": 661, "char_end": 693}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "quote", "index": 17, "text": "Dr. Drake Ramoray was a neurosurgeon working at the fictional hospital on Days of Our Lives. He is first introduced in \"The One With Russ\" and first seen in \"The One With The Lesbian Wedding\". His stint on the show ended when Joey angered its writers after telling an interviewer that he wrote many o", "char_start": 695, "char_end": 1269, "sample_truncated": true}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "当明星还要抢幕后人员的功，这是行内不可容忍的缺德行为，这是在中国编剧工会不强大（这也是中国文艺质量差的一个重要原因），不然董现在真正的麻烦不是自己的母公司，而是编剧协会的集体封杀和诉讼了。", "char_start": 1270, "char_end": 1364}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "说实话，看了一些董宇辉的直播，这稿子是他自己写的概率并不乐观。", "char_start": 1365, "char_end": 1396}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "他现在也应该吃到教训了，这类话估计也不敢再随便说了。问题是，他也很可能因此失去了那种镜头前的自信，再要他像以前那样毫无心理障碍的播出念词，恐怕短期也是办不到的了。", "char_start": 1397, "char_end": 1478}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2023-12/17/daca398875f5761c3c8de33558eaf2d7.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 20, "image": 1, "quote": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0323"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：俞敏洪、董宇辉今晚合体直播，有哪些信息值得关注？能彻底平息本次风波吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“德雷克医生”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“其实网友们拼命的站队董宇辉和站队站队董宇辉的大V们，在内心深处都是在希望促成一个“平民明星战胜资本”的梦。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "其实网友们拼命的站队董宇辉和站队站队董宇辉的大V们，在内心深处都是在希望促成一个“平民明星战胜资本”的梦。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 53, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8a9eed4f-6430-50f0-b503-3f53db45eaf2", "source_ordinal": 1882, "reading_ordinal": 2174, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "般若波罗蜜", "published_at": "2023-12-17T23:32:41+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/8456b23a9cf111ee8a5652540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你这样想问题，简直是上赶着找抑郁症得啊。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为人是极少对人说假话的。", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 34}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "不好说就干脆不说，说了就一定不会随便让你抓到小辫子。除了少数没活醒、没吃够教训的妄人，大部分成熟的人，说的都是不能算假话的“委婉话”，而不是假话。", "char_start": 35, "char_end": 108}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "说假话，是要背责任、招怨恨的。大家一般都是靠本事吃饭，务求万事稳定，不要横生枝节、无故树敌。你算是个啥？骗你能一次骗到能跑路退休的钱吗？要是说骗完你能让你人间蒸发，不留任何后患？", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 198}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "我又不是在缅北——骗了你反正你也够不着，我跟你就一个学校、一个部门、一个市区的，骗完了我赚到啥了？", "char_start": 199, "char_end": 248}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你自以为被“骗走”的那些“损失”，只是你自己看得非常值钱，其实对别人根本没你想的那么重要，拿来当别人“处心积虑”的“原因”，其实根本就不够油钱。", "char_start": 249, "char_end": 321}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你的“上当”绝大部分都来自把别人的委婉话自己顺势从三分脑补成七八分，七八分幻想成九十分。", "char_start": 322, "char_end": 366}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "多跟你说句“学长好”，你就要脑补学妹暗示情意。第二天看到学妹跟别人一起上自习，你就“被欺骗了”，“心碎了”。", "char_start": 367, "char_end": 421}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "同事说一句“你真厉害，离了你这事可办不成”，你就开始想象人家期末一定会给你打高绩效。回头拿到C级评定，你就要大怒“有人当面一套背后一套”。", "char_start": 422, "char_end": 491}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "要感叹人“为什么总要说假话”，要“欺骗感情”。", "char_start": 492, "char_end": 515}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "来来来，不跟你说学长好，是对你不礼貌、不热情。跟你说一句，就是要跟你从一而终。前一个判铁锤击杀，后一种判硫酸汽油。你死亡笔记啊你，挨上你就只能选哪种死法吗？", "char_start": 516, "char_end": 594}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "看着这话似乎荒唐可笑，但只要一个人会发出“人与人相处为何要说谎话”这样的“大哉问”，这人的判定方式已经与此无异了。", "char_start": 595, "char_end": 652}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "若不是将所有的委婉话、曲折话都算成谎话，你怎么会发这种浩叹呢？如果把这类话从谎话的定义里去掉，你遇上的硬核欺骗——这是指以能上法庭取得赔偿为准——数量能多到你发出这种级别的警世通言吗？", "char_start": 653, "char_end": 745}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "现在再把话说回来。", "char_start": 746, "char_end": 755}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你是觉得你自己受得了你所渴望的那种“实话”吗？", "char_start": 756, "char_end": 779}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你别开玩笑了。", "char_start": 780, "char_end": 787}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "那些自称可以接受别人无限诚实的人，一句“我没感觉”的大实话就可以憋得ta想杀人。", "char_start": 788, "char_end": 828}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "咋了，没感觉就是没感觉啊，你不是要诚实吗？老张你为什么脸色发青、笑得这么难看？你为什么要跟我说“其实我也不喜欢你吃饭吧唧嘴”？", "char_start": 829, "char_end": 892}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "我又没问你，你为啥要拿这话来跟我对对联？这是在用你说实话来惩罚我说实话吗？", "char_start": 893, "char_end": 930}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "奇怪，你为什么觉得刚才这句实话应该被惩罚？而且你为什么觉得可以用说实话来实施这种惩罚？", "char_start": 931, "char_end": 974}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "哦，所以你是知道实话可以是一种折磨的，而且你不欢迎所有的实话，不是吗？", "char_start": 975, "char_end": 1010}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "那你老老实实的按你自己的本来就知道的真相来不行吗？", "char_start": 1011, "char_end": 1036}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你为什么要对我说“我欢迎一切畅所欲言、真实反馈”这种谎言呢？", "char_start": 1037, "char_end": 1067}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "人与人相处，为什么要说“我要听全部实话”这种谎话呢？老张？", "char_start": 1068, "char_end": 1097}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "好了，老张，你别纠结了，我刚才说没感觉是骗你的。", "char_start": 1099, "char_end": 1123}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "矮油，一说我说了谎，你就高兴了？", "char_start": 1124, "char_end": 1140}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "什么？我这句“骗你的”是不是又是在骗你？", "char_start": 1141, "char_end": 1161}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这个嘛……", "char_start": 1162, "char_end": 1167}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你猜？", "char_start": 1168, "char_end": 1171}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "觀自在菩薩，行深般若波羅蜜多時，照見五蘊皆空，度一切苦厄。", "char_start": 1173, "char_end": 1202}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "对众生慈悲，自己才得解脱。", "char_start": 1203, "char_end": 1216}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 33}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0323"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：现实中为什么人与人相处要说假话？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031"], "summary": "围绕“般若波罗蜜”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你这样想问题，简直是上赶着找抑郁症得啊。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你这样想问题，简直是上赶着找抑郁症得啊。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 20, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d4e5bd07-5688-588a-b786-fc9620c9609a", "source_ordinal": 1881, "reading_ordinal": 2175, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "代糖", "published_at": "2023-12-18T00:38:16+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/634310262/answer/3329302787"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "信念坚定看上去是什么样子的？是比较安静的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "安静了，你才坚定了。", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 32}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "很多人以为咬牙切齿、横眉立目、热血沸腾、大声疾呼、大量辩论、广泛宣传是坚定的表现，其实这是不对的。", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 82}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这些是半信半疑的表现，是犹豫、焦虑的表现，不是信念坚定的表现。", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "有敌人，不妨碍我要做这事；成功希望渺茫，不妨碍我做这事；这个那个不认同，不妨碍我做这事；没有同志，不妨碍我做这事；有没有利润，不妨碍我做这事；能不能活下来，也不妨碍我做这事。", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "所谓信念，就是没有任何投机性的定意，无论外界条件发生任何变化，都不妨碍、不影响这件事情本身，这件事就成了信念。", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 258}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "信念不见得一定要是“解放全人类”、“创造世界和平”，也可以是“我要把萝卜雕花学会”，可以是“我要减到100斤以下”，甚至可以是“我一定要买到这个玩具”。", "char_start": 259, "char_end": 335}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "信念也不一定是良性的——例如你完全可能坚信“永动机是可能的”或者坚持“要把体脂率降到0”，然后一头碰死在南墙上——行不通（即为自然法所不容的）信念每一个都是叛逆自然法者的坟场。", "char_start": 336, "char_end": 424}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "但这是“如何判断信念的可用性”的问题，而不是“信念本身是什么样”的问题。", "char_start": 425, "char_end": 461}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "关于“信念是什么样”，答案就是这样——信念是安静的。", "char_start": 462, "char_end": 488}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "那些辩论、宣传、争取，当然都是为了帮助信念实现，但绝不是为了“鼓舞信心”。", "char_start": 489, "char_end": 526}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "因为信念不需要信心。", "char_start": 527, "char_end": 537}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "信心只是信念的代糖，只提供甜味，不提供热量。", "char_start": 538, "char_end": 560}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "当你发现需要什么资源来维持你的“信心”，来支撑你“坚持下去”的时候，你并不处于基于信念行动的状态。", "char_start": 561, "char_end": 610}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "不是就不是，你要实事求是，这并不是什么丢脸的事，不基于信念，只是基于信心进行投机也是人类的基本生存常态之一。", "char_start": 611, "char_end": 665}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "基于信念本来就是极为罕见、需要一定天赐才能有的特殊情况，你手上在做的这件事不是基于信念，而是处于某种你觉得不抓住可惜的偶然条件、个人优势，这无比的正常，没有必要懊恼。", "char_start": 666, "char_end": 749}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "但这同样不改变“信念是什么样”的答案。", "char_start": 750, "char_end": 769}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "很多人真正犯的错误，是羡慕信念的强大，于是要改掉“信念态”的定义，通过悄悄挪界碑来把自己现在的投机行为拧成“信念态”。然后通过这种自欺欺人，想要骗过自然法，混到自然法专门分发给信念态的专属福利。", "char_start": 770, "char_end": 867}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "什么专属福利？信念态的人做的事情，人类会不由自主的自动考虑让路。", "char_start": 868, "char_end": 900}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "因为这些人就像盾构机，是不跟你“讲道理”的。什么非要挡在前面，要么就是这东西被打穿一个洞，要么就是盾构机顶在ta脑门上过热爆炸解体。", "char_start": 901, "char_end": 967}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "一切有灵之物，都会自动的尽可能给盾构机让路，这点技能都没有，智能程度可能都没高过一个扫地机。", "char_start": 968, "char_end": 1014}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "要不是有这么大的福利，为什么会有这么多人要强壮信念呢？", "char_start": 1015, "char_end": 1042}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0323"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：张译主演的《三大队》到底怎么样？值得去电影院看吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“代糖”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“信念坚定看上去是什么样子的？是比较安静的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "信念坚定看上去是什么样子的？是比较安静的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f58456c0-4496-50b1-a139-d7c62fde025f", "source_ordinal": 1880, "reading_ordinal": 2176, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "负智慧", "published_at": "2023-12-18T01:18:08+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/634794237/answer/3329320923"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "法条本身几乎是全球最严格的立法规格，没有什么可多说的。这也是意料之中的事——中国一向在这类问题上都是全球最保守、最谨慎的国家之一。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "但很多人对这法条修订的反应倒是很值得说几句。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 88}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这是特指一些阴阳怪气的言论。", "char_start": 89, "char_end": 103}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "众所周知，我是一向坚决反对任何阴阳怪气行为的——有话直说，不要装神弄鬼。现在撇开阴阳怪气本身的猥琐性不谈，只谈这些阴阳怪气的诉求本身——这是在诉求什么？", "char_start": 104, "char_end": 180}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "是诉求完全取消一切器官移植，让这些病人全部去死吗？还是诉求改法条？那么要改成什么样？能不能直接说个更好的版本来听听？", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 239}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "至于不停的暗示“有某种合法手段可以绕过管制”，这是要主张什么观点？要立一种没有任何可能办法哪怕疑似的绕过的法律？比如怎么立？来，笔给你，你来写一条没有任何办法可以绕的法条给我看看？", "char_start": 240, "char_end": 330}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这就像劳动法规定不得超标加班，员工拿到超标加班的凭证可以起诉企业——结果台下阴阳怪气“那我们企业加班从来不留凭证”。", "char_start": 331, "char_end": 389}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "那你啥意思？是要劳动法删掉“不许超标加班”这条？还是要删掉“需要提供超标加班的证据”这条？", "char_start": 390, "char_end": 435}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "来，你要删掉哪条？删掉哪条你更满意？", "char_start": 436, "char_end": 454}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "还是说你在主张“因为有合法手段可以绕，所以不如废除一切法律”？", "char_start": 456, "char_end": 487}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "老实说，不断的有人鼓吹、售卖这类极其廉价的、实则是扯淡的庸俗的真空中的正义观，这不奇怪，因为总有一些人爱买入、爱奖励这样的行为。有利可图，当然总有人无视廉耻——廉耻也是可以再定义的嘛。", "char_start": 488, "char_end": 580}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "真正值得反思的，是什么时候你自己才能长大点，停止做这种愚蠢而无效的自毁行为？", "char_start": 581, "char_end": 619}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "不错，这是自毁行为。", "char_start": 620, "char_end": 630}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因为你自认为认同这类“智慧的洞察”会让人对你的思考深度感到赞叹，但在实际上你却会在真正管理组织、领导团队的人眼里被打上“思想幼稚且脱离实际、没有反思和独立思考能力，极易因无意识的情绪而受人利用”的烙印。", "char_start": 631, "char_end": 732}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你不知道被打上这样的印记，对你是多少年的惨烈代价。这些年里你注定要冷板凳坐穿，被所有人当透明背景。", "char_start": 733, "char_end": 782}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "而人要对你做这判语，只需要你说几句这种不负责任、不过大脑的蠢话。", "char_start": 783, "char_end": 815}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "为什么每次谈恋爱对方父母就是坚决反对？为什么什么机会都轮不到你？为什么被提拔的总是别人？", "char_start": 816, "char_end": 860}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "因为你不但看不出这类话有多不负责任、不知好歹，还给它们点赞。", "char_start": 861, "char_end": 891}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "吹毛求疵，讽刺世界不如理想完美，这算哪门子智慧？", "char_start": 892, "char_end": 916}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "达到这种水平，甚至不需要识字。你在炫耀一种连识字都不需要就能达到的“智慧”，还在指望人家赞叹、夸奖。", "char_start": 917, "char_end": 967}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这是一种负智慧。", "char_start": 968, "char_end": 976}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "越炫耀，你的品牌价值越低。", "char_start": 977, "char_end": 990}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "一些阴阳怪气的人的主要观点是：默认生前没有明确表达捐赠意见的人死后是否捐赠取决于家属，于是自己给自己设想了一个“家属和器官需求者串通谋害自己分器官”的黑暗前景。", "char_start": 991, "char_end": 1071}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "然后开始高唱“不敢结婚”。", "char_start": 1072, "char_end": 1085}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "这么说吧，如果这就会导致你不敢结婚，那么你估计没有这条法律也结不了婚了。", "char_start": 1086, "char_end": 1122}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "因为根据同一原理，你的遗产现在就是这么处置的。", "char_start": 1123, "char_end": 1146}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "你大概也不敢买那种受益人是配偶的保险——对方买了怎么办？", "char_start": 1147, "char_end": 1175}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "也不敢让配偶接触家庭财务。", "char_start": 1176, "char_end": 1189}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "也不敢让配偶决定旅游目的地。", "char_start": 1190, "char_end": 1204}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "甚至不敢让配偶接孩子——万一人家把孩子带走消失了、勒索探视费咋办？这还是法律空白呢。", "char_start": 1205, "char_end": 1247}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这还有无防护性关系可能感染被隐瞒疾病问题，还有莫名背上共同债务问题。", "char_start": 1248, "char_end": 1282}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "是的，你们的担心很有道理，但你们还指望靠政府立法、靠警察叔叔站岗来解决你们的“结婚恐惧”，你们自己想想可不可行。", "char_start": 1283, "char_end": 1339}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "没这个胆子，那就安全而孤独的默默消失吧。因为你不管怎么哭喊，你也不可能喊出一个能帮你解决这种程度的恐惧的法律或者政府来。", "char_start": 1340, "char_end": 1400}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "道理很简单，一个能帮你解决到“这个程度”的法律、行政体系所需要的成本，把你的遗产全部没收、器官全卖了去交税都付不起。", "char_start": 1401, "char_end": 1459}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "人活在世上，总不能一点勇气都用不着吧？", "char_start": 1460, "char_end": 1479}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 36}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0323"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：《人体器官捐献和移植条例》公布，明年 5 月 1 日起施行，有哪些信息值得关注？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035"], "summary": "围绕“负智慧”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“法条本身几乎是全球最严格的立法规格，没有什么可多说的。这也是意料之中的事——中国一向在这类问题上都是全球最保守、最谨慎的国家之一。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "法条本身几乎是全球最严格的立法规格，没有什么可多说的。这也是意料之中的事——中国一向在这类问题上都是全球最保守、最谨慎的国家之一。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 65, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "dbe761df-b810-5878-adab-abb098be23b4", "source_ordinal": 1879, "reading_ordinal": 2177, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "所谓消费", "published_at": "2023-12-20T03:10:05+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/635463419/answer/3331819406"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "什么叫资本？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "“可以产生价值增值的本金”才叫资本。", "char_start": 7, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "我做了个桶，每天拿这桶打水去卖，这个桶对我就是工具资本。", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 54}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "我深耕建筑业二十年，凭这个声望拿来赚取设计费、监理费——这个对我算智力资本。", "char_start": 55, "char_end": 93}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "我练了三年，三分球神准，我拿来打比赛分出场费，这副身手是身体资本。", "char_start": 94, "char_end": 127}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "我出一笔钱，换了他的股份，后来它上市了，我的股本可以拿来分取新公司的分红，拿去卖也可以卖出更高价格，这笔钱对我是金融资本。", "char_start": 128, "char_end": 189}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "我拿了两万块去蹦迪。喝得断了片。第二天醒来除了头痛欲裂、模糊的记忆和强烈的悔恨，我获得的主要价值是啥？", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 241}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "不以赚取更多利润为目的而被运用的资金，不叫资本，而叫“余额”。", "char_start": 242, "char_end": 273}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "“蹦迪”、“吃山珍海味”、“买个痛快”、“爽一下”……这些不叫做“以赚取更多利润为目的”。", "char_start": 274, "char_end": 319}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "资本是贪婪的，正因为它是贪婪的，所以它的本性也是节约的、吝啬的。开雅阁的贝索斯、住移动板房的马斯克、拧紧水龙头的洛克菲勒、自己剪头的巴菲特才是资本家的典范，而不是什么花钱养老虎、换豪车、撩模特的泰森、罗德曼。", "char_start": 320, "char_end": 424}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "大家把话说透——中国人、中华民族根本不信所谓“消费振兴经济”的理论邪教。", "char_start": 425, "char_end": 461}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "中国人只信开源节流。", "char_start": 462, "char_end": 472}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "吃饭是为了延续生命、恢复活力，中国人永远会选能达到这两个目的最具性价比的选择，只有极少数人会例外，而且这些人绝不会被中国人视为做人典范。", "char_start": 474, "char_end": 542}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "买车是为了改善机动性，争取更高的社会授信评估和更多的可支配时间，中国人永远会选能达到这些个目的最具性价比的选择，只有极少数人会例外，而且这些人绝不会被中国人视为做人典范。", "char_start": 543, "char_end": 628}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "任何东西，中国人都会考虑其实用意义和性价比，只有极少数人会例外，而这些人绝不会被中国人视为典范。", "char_start": 629, "char_end": 677}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你就是泼天般富贵，如果你挥霍浪费，或许有人羡慕、妒忌，但羡慕、妒忌不叫认可、赞同。", "char_start": 678, "char_end": 719}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "“真有钱，不过有这么多钱，干点什么不好。”", "char_start": 720, "char_end": 741}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "中国几千年的文化，在本质上根本不认可“消费”这个概念，一切都是投资。", "char_start": 742, "char_end": 776}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "现在中国面对的问题，本质上完全不是“老百姓不愿消费”，而是“老百姓不愿投资”。", "char_start": 777, "char_end": 816}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "不愿意投资更多的房产、不愿投资买入更好的车、不愿意投资进一步的外在的实力证明、不愿意投资更好的电脑、手机。", "char_start": 817, "char_end": 870}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "如果ta找到了赚钱的模式，发现自己跑不过来，一反手买架私人飞机也只是合理投入。但ta们对这些投入的回报没有把握。", "char_start": 871, "char_end": 927}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "ta们怕换了更好的车也谈不下更好的单子，怕花钱游学并不能带来更好的工作，怕宴请招待也拿不到尾款。", "char_start": 928, "char_end": 976}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "他们不是不愿消费，除了极少数根本不招人待见的例外，中国人是从来不消费的。", "char_start": 977, "char_end": 1013}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "再说一遍，中国人只投资，你要想办法帮助他们敢于升级自己对自己的投资。", "char_start": 1014, "char_end": 1048}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "投资永远是熟手、赢家的欲望和力度比新手、输家大。", "char_start": 1049, "char_end": 1073}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "所以在中国永远不要谈什么“年轻人是消费（投资）主力”的谬论。", "char_start": 1074, "char_end": 1104}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "中国绝大多数投资都只会、也只能来自中年人。", "char_start": 1105, "char_end": 1126}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "“年轻人要成为主力”只有一个办法，就是“五十岁以下都算年轻人”这种统计魔法。", "char_start": 1127, "char_end": 1165}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "除非你把中国几千年历史抹去，否则不要说这类废话。", "char_start": 1166, "char_end": 1190}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你能抹去吗？还是你觉得靠盎格鲁撒克逊暴发户们拍个几十年影视剧就能抹去？", "char_start": 1191, "char_end": 1226}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "劝你不要下这种赌注，你输定了。", "char_start": 1227, "char_end": 1242}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 32}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0323"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎么看待经济学家付鹏说的：假如年轻人掌握资本，就不存在资本过剩问题？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031"], "summary": "围绕“所谓消费”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“什么叫资本？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "什么叫资本？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 6, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1c33583c-7991-53a9-b5ac-2cd3cc166498", "source_ordinal": 1878, "reading_ordinal": 2178, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "支持渔夫的鱼", "published_at": "2023-12-22T22:24:23+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/636086406/answer/3335267471"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是鱼们在抱怨鱼塘管理员禁止使用高压电和鱼炮吗？是鱼们在害怕渔夫要是没有足够的收获，就不会到鱼塘里来打窝子了？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 55}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你们不觉得一禁这些手段就股价大跌的企业本身有点问题吗？", "char_start": 56, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "做事业，一定要凭本事诉诸人的神性吃饭，不要利用人的兽性发财。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不要以恶为业。", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 122}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "以恶为业的那部分，随时随地可能倒塌下来把你掩埋。", "char_start": 123, "char_end": 147}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 5}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0323"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：国家新闻出版署征求意见，网络游戏不得设置每日登录、首次充值、连续充值等诱导性奖励，将带来哪些影响？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005"], "summary": "围绕“支持渔夫的鱼”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是鱼们在抱怨鱼塘管理员禁止使用高压电和鱼炮吗？是鱼们在害怕渔夫要是没有足够的收获，就不会到鱼塘里来打窝子了？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是鱼们在抱怨鱼塘管理员禁止使用高压电和鱼炮吗？是鱼们在害怕渔夫要是没有足够的收获，就不会到鱼塘里来打窝子了？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 55, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d24e1357-bc68-5c6b-b3db-14656d80de5b", "source_ordinal": 1877, "reading_ordinal": 2179, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "志愿参战", "published_at": "2023-12-23T03:27:24+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/635918875/answer/3335421256"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这么说吧——任何志愿参战的人员，除非是为了金钱，否则无论是加入哪一方、因为何种理由，只要ta没有违反交战规则、没有临阵脱逃，在最基本的层面上，总是令人敬佩的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 79}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "志愿援俄的也是，志愿援乌的也是。", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 96}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "人勇气大到可以直面死亡时，ta的信念就不再有人类有资格评价了。", "char_start": 97, "char_end": 128}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "仅仅因为立场不同，就把对面的志愿参战者描述为白痴、傻瓜，这只是缺少勇气和同理心的猥琐行为。", "char_start": 129, "char_end": 174}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这种“聪明”为人所不屑，这种“正义”也自然为人所不齿。", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "即使是敌人，只要对方真诚的赌上性命，那就要有一份最基本的尊重。人的信念到底对不对，要留给历史评价。但作为同类，你不能不敬佩为自己的决定主动拼死的人。", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 277}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "对那些不是为了钱或者骗关注度、骗点击率而前往乌克兰参战，并且没有临阵脱逃、有负使命的外籍志愿兵，至少在我这里也享有一样的待遇。", "char_start": 278, "char_end": 341}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这都是比我们更有勇气的人。", "char_start": 342, "char_end": 355}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "嘲笑ta们的人，自己才是小丑——在这些人看来，任何勇气都很愚蠢，所以ta们永远活在聪明才智想象的恐怖丛林中，靠着抱团嘲笑敢于走出丛林的人来安慰自己龟缩在山洞里是最聪明的选择。", "char_start": 356, "char_end": 443}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0323"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价一中国男子参加俄军阵亡？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“志愿参战”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这么说吧——任何志愿参战的人员，除非是为了金钱，否则无论是加入哪一方、因为何种理由，只要ta没有违反交战规则、没有临阵脱逃，在最基本的层面上，总是令人敬佩的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这么说吧——任何志愿参战的人员，除非是为了金钱，否则无论是加入哪一方、因为何种理由，只要ta没有违反交战规则、没有临阵脱逃，在最基本的层面上，总是令人敬佩的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 79, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
